Association EdFi.StudentDisciplineIncidentNonOffenderAssociation additions
    descriptor IncidentRelatedTo
        documentation "Indicates the reason for the alleged bullying incident."
        is required
        role name Reason
    date ReportDate
        documentation "Indicates the date on which the alleged bullying incident was reported."
        is required
    domain entity EdFi.Staff
        documentation "Identifies the staff who reported."
        is optional
    shared string Detail
        documentation "The details of the alleged bullying victim incident."
        is optional
        role name BullyingVictimIncident
    descriptor BullyingCategory
        documentation "Indicates the type of bullying."
        is optional collection